Acceptance criteria:
Actual Claire geometry/renderer, same source speech, strength, gain, camera and
topology on both sides. Original reference retained unchanged. Candidate labelled
review-only, not an already universal expression. Preserve the approved first
preview separately from the subsequently requested stronger candidate. Mouth-only smooth
addition preserves the rest of the source; no new model/download/device access,
source app changes, protected-head interruption or independent-listening claim.

